# Local operational state for the contract gate: session ids, this
# machine's classification history, token usage. Never shared.

# ADLC per-developer session state.
# Local operational state for the contract gate: session ids, this
# machine's classification history, token usage. Never shared.
#
# `**/` is required: a pattern with a mid-path slash is anchored to the
# repo root, so a bare `.adlc/session/` misses services/api/.adlc/session/.
**/.adlc/session/
/.run/e2e-log-offset

# Task's own checksum cache.
.task/
